# Keep the bazel-cache-image build context (see
# .devcontainer/Dockerfile.bazel-cache) limited to real source: symlinks,
# worktrees, and VCS metadata below would either confuse a recursive
# `bazel build //...` pattern or bloat the context for no benefit (git
# history isn't a build input). The plain .devcontainer/Dockerfile doesn't
# COPY the repo at all, but still benefits from a smaller context to hash.
.git
.claude/worktrees
bazel-*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
